'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page seven of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 7|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|50|notext}} and 35 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Scout}}

==Lore==
The SC-30's design traces its roots back to the [[Helldivers 1:Armor#Ranger|Mk-8 Ranger]], a hallmark of the [[Galactic War#First Galactic War (Helldivers 1)|First Galactic War]]. Although that uniform remains unavailable to [[Helldiver]]s during the [[Galactic War#Second Galactic War (Helldivers 2)|Second]], its influence is unmistakable—as evidenced by the helmet.

